    tmk:text "(a) all particulars of registered trade marks, certification trade marks and defensive trade marks, and all other matters, that were on the old register when the repealed Act was repealed, with the exception of particulars and other matters relating to registered users of trade marks; and" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s207(2)(a)" .

