    tmk:ordinal 8 ;
    tmk:text "(3) If 2 or more trade marks were entered as associated trade marks in the old register, no equivalent entry designating them as associated trade marks is to be made in the Register." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s207(3)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s207(3)~1> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
