    tmk:text "(b) a person whose claim to an interest in, or to a right in respect of, a trade mark is recorded in the Register;" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s216(2)(b)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s216~1> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
