    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s4(f)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s4(f)~1> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s4> ;
