    tmk:ordinal 118 ;
    tmk:text "(3) Despite subsection 14(2) of the Legislation Act 2003, regulations made for the purposes of the definition of Convention country in subsection (1) may make provision in relation to a matter by applying, adopting or incorporating, with or without modification, any matter contained in any other instrument or other writing as in force or existing from time to time." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s6(3)" .

