    tmk:ordinal 4 ;
    tmk:text "(i) if the Registrar’s decision, or (in the case of an appeal against the Registrar’s decision) the decision on appeal, is that the trade mark should be registered; or" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s68(1)(b)(i)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s68(1)(b)(ii)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
