    tmk:ordinal 2 ;
    tmk:text "(a) using the trade mark in relation to any or all of the goods or services in respect of which the trade mark is registered would be inconsistent with any relevant obligation of Australia under an international agreement; and" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s83A(1)(a)" .

