    tmk:ordinal 4 ;
    tmk:text "(2) The registered owner of the registered trade mark may, in writing, request the Registrar to do either or both of the following:" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s83A(2)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s83A(2)(a)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
