    tmk:ordinal 14 ;
    tmk:text "Note 1: Sections 24 and 25 provide that the registered owner of a trade mark does not have exclusive rights to use, or to authorise the use of, the trade mark if it consists of, or contains, a sign that:" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s87~3~1" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s87~3~2> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
