    tmk:ordinal 16 ;
    tmk:text "(b) is the only commonly known way to describe or identify an article formerly exploited under a patent, or a service formerly provided as a patented process, where the patent has expired more than 2 years ago." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s87~3~3" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s87~3~4> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
