    tmk:ordinal 2 ;
    tmk:text "(a) a trade mark is taken to be applied to any goods, material or thing if it is woven in, impressed on, worked into, or affixed or annexed to, the goods, material or thing; and" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s9(1)(a)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s9(1)(b)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
