    tmk:contentHash "sha256:4d69df549f70bb2494cc7e92f1cdda7efacc31b4eae42dba5e234f8d99f70739" ;
    tmk:ordinal 5 ;
    tmk:text "(3) An application may not be made to the Registrar under subsection (1) if an action concerning the trade mark is pending in a prescribed court, but the person may apply to the court for an order directing the Registrar to remove the trade mark from the Register." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s92(3)" .

