    tmk:ordinal 1 ;
    tmk:text "(1) In any proceedings relating to a trade mark that is the subject of an IRDA or is a protected international trade mark, a copy of any of the following documents is admissible in evidence:" ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r17A.69(1)" .

