    tmk:ordinal 8 ;
    tmk:text "(3) Before awarding costs in respect of the proceedings, the Registrar must give each party to the proceedings a reasonable opportunity to be heard in relation to the award of costs." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r21.12(3)" .

