    tmk:ordinal 12 ;
    tmk:text "(5) In addition to the Registrar’s other powers, the Registrar may direct a person to provide a written summary of submissions." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r21.16(5)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.16(6)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
