    tmk:ordinal 1 ;
    tmk:text "For the purposes of subsection 29(1) of the Act (which deals with claims for priority), the prescribed period in relation to a claim for a right of priority for an application is 2 working days after filing the application." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r4.5~1" .

