    tmk:ordinal 15 ;
    tmk:text "(5) If an application is made under subsection (2) or (3) for an extension of time for more than 3 months, the Registrar must publish the application in accordance with the regulations." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s224(5)" .

