    tmk:text "(5) If the Registrar decides that the information filed under paragraph (3)(a) rectifies the inadequacy of the statement, the Registrar must give a copy of the statement and the information filed in relation to paragraph (3)(a) to the holder of the IRDA." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMR1995/r17A.34B(5)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.34C(4)(a)> a tmk:LegislativeUnit ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995>,
