<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s106> a tmk:LegislativeProvision ;
    rdfs:label "Assignment etc. of trade mark"@en-AU ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:a3e2bb115e3a7480288c366a8729160798d7682dcbea077fa85f6e6068b99bf9" ;
    tmk:text "(1) A registered trade mark, or a trade mark whose registration is being sought, may be assigned or transmitted in accordance with this section. (2) The assignment or transmission may be partial, that is, it may apply to some only of the goods and/or services in respect of which registration is sought or the trade mark is registered, but it may not be partial in relation to the use of a trade mark in a particular area. (3) The assignment or transmission may be with or without the goodwill of the business concerned in the relevant goods and/or services. Note: For assignment and transmission see section 6." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s106" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s108> a tmk:LegislativeProvision ;
    rdfs:label "Recording of assignment etc. of trade mark whose registration is sought"@en-AU ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995> ;
    tmk:authorityKind "law" ;
    tmk:authorityStatus tmk:Current ;
    tmk:capturedIn tmk:snapshot-c490a9927f1a ;
    tmk:contentHash "sha256:661be0d0c562247128314b3dcdefb7a9d12f8d06ee72a07a75b7a98ca9bde503" ;
    tmk:text "(1) If the application complies with this Act, the Registrar must: (a) at, or within, the time provided for in the regulations, record in the manner that the Registrar thinks fit (but not in the Register) the particulars of the assignment or transmission; and (b) publish the particulars of the assignment or transmission in accordance with the regulations. (2) On and after the day on which the Registrar records the particulars of the assignment or transmission, the person to whom the trade mark has been assigned or transmitted is taken, for the purposes of this Act, to be the applicant for the registration of the trade mark." ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s108" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s15(1)> tmk:authorityStatus tmk:NotHeld ;
    tmk:upstreamRef "TMA1995/s15(1)" .

<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s15(1)(a)> tmk:authorityStatus tmk:NotHeld ;
